<div class="bhd-page__keypoints" aria-label="Research principles">
  <div><strong>Status before spin</strong><span>Published, accepted, active, planned and exploratory work are labelled differently. We do not present future work as completed evidence.</span></div>
  <div><strong>Mechanism is not proof</strong><span>Established physiology can explain why a research question is reasonable, but product-specific claims require product-specific evidence.</span></div>
  <div><strong>Translation matters</strong><span>Our long-term goal is to connect hydration science with practical performance, clinical and humanitarian applications without overstating what the evidence can support.</span></div>
</div>

