    <h2>Best Hydrate co-authors have an accepted review in Frontiers in Nutrition</h2>
    <p><strong>Revisiting the Need for Innovative Oral Hydration Technologies</strong> is an accepted review article in <em>Frontiers in Nutrition</em>, Sport and Exercise Nutrition, Volume 13 (2026). The article is authored by Genevieve Vine, Simone Persaud, Austin Swiniarski and Spencer Proctor.</p>
    <p>Frontiers lists the article as accepted on August 27, 2026 and has assigned DOI <strong>10.3389/fnut.2026.1851906</strong>. At the time of this page build, Frontiers states that the final formatted version will be published soon.</p>
    <p>The review discusses oral hydration technology across physiology, exercise and clinical contexts. It is evidence of scholarly contribution, not proof that every proposition in the review has been established for the finished Best Hydrate product.</p>
